  {
    "id": 4901700480010,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "──入り時間、間違えるとか\r\nほんと……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030240020",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当にすまなかった\r\nお腹、空いてるか？　なんでも好きなもの────",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0454"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480020,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "……１時間後には収録現場、戻らないとなんですよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480030,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "お腹いっぱいの状態で入るとか、どうなんですかねー",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\nなら、ケーキとかどうだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00762",
    "fg": "fade_out",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000,
    "bgEffectTime": 500,
    "fgEffectTime": 200
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、限定のデザートプレートもあるみたいだぞ\r\nもみの木の形したケーキとか、クリスマスらしいな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480040,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00022",
    "fg": "000221",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "fgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "fgEffectTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480050,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "ていうかこれ、1,780円って……\r\n高すぎ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480050"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480060,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "お皿にいろいろ載ってるけど、\r\nこれ絶対、値段以上の価値ないやつ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close3",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのかな……？　トナカイのプチシューとか、\r\nいちごのムースとか、美味しそうだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480070,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "そうですねー\r\n美味しそうですねー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……じゃあ頼んでみるか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480080,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "にちかが食べたい分だけでいいからさ\r\n一口ずつでも構わない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480090,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "……それも、なんか──",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、たまにはいいんじゃないか\r\nクリスマスも近いことだしさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480100,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "え、もしかして──\r\nこれクリスマスプレゼントにしようとしてます？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480100"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480110,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "それはそれで、考えておくので",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480110"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700480120,
    "speaker": "にちか",
    "text": "デザートプレートは、\r\n今日のお詫びとしてもらっておきますねー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "nichika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170048/4901700480120"
